# MASTER PROMPT: PERSONAL FINANCE MANAGER
## Multi-User | Multi-Device | Fully Responsive | Offline-First Financial Web Application

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, financial application developer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity engineer, and QA specialist.

Your task is to BUILD a complete, functional, production-oriented Personal Finance Management Web Application.

